      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, I'm not sure I follow the last part. Could you just stick to the physics? I'm seeing some highly irregular spikes in the salinity readings at the 6000m mark that don't seem to correlate with the temperature sensors. What would cause those kinds of erratic sensor readings in a deep-sea AUV deployment?",
